       "text": "Greetings recruits, long time no see....",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is just to let you know about the 2024 calendar downloadable content update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2023 is near to end and I have updated the girls calendars so you can enjoy the new images of 2024, I hope you like them, I am planning new content for this game and I hope you will be attentive to it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
