  {
   "id": "queeny-army-126565@1.3.2",
   "gameId": "queeny-army-126565",
   "displayName": "Update 1.3.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-11-04T00:15:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings Recruits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today is the Queeny Army Anniversary and we celebrate it with a new update that contains changes and improvements to the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gallery",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This is a new section for all those who like to complete 100% of the game and it is about the gallery, when you finish the game in Oldschool mode collecting all the medals you get a hot reward from the girl with whom you finished the game, Well, now you can view and collect all the photos in this gallery. Will you be able to get all of them?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Graphic changes to the enemy 'Helicopter'",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new enemy helicopter was made that replaces the small one-man helicopter does exactly the same but now it is more aesthetic and more precise.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Corrections",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Now the motorcycle mission has been fixed, in the previous version enemy motorcycles no longer appeared and now they appear normally.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the motorcycle stopped moving.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Arms Balance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "CERT power increased from 1 to 2 damage units per bullet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And this would be all for this patch, I hope you continue to enjoy the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PS: It seems that the problems with the Linux version persist, I hope that the users of said platform have patience until I manage to solve the incident, anyway they can play the Windows version Using Proton it will only be up to New notice, the native version will come back when possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "See you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
