  {
   "id": "queeny-army-126565@1.2.22",
   "gameId": "queeny-army-126565",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2.22",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-05-29T06:12:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings recruits!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I don't have much time and this patch was a bit improvised so in summary let's see what this new update brings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New home screen",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new dynamic home screen, only changes its aesthetic appearance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "trace on certain weapons!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To be honest I would have liked to add this aesthetic aspect but I was afraid for the performance of the game, but doing a few optimizations I was able to achieve it and here it is, now the grenade launchers, the rocket launchers and the Snipers leave a trail that looks very nice and gives it a Little more life to the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Change to the background of mission 2 and darkening of tileset in general",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Another aesthetic change that I wanted to make and that gives the game in general a bit darker and is now available, I hope you like it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And it seems that is all, I hope you like these changes made to the game, see you in the next patch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
