      },
      {
       "text": "-Corrected some texts that were not where they belonged",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And finally the character selection images were replaced by new ones.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
