  {
   "id": "queeny-army-126565@1.2.1",
   "gameId": "queeny-army-126565",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-03-13T07:33:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings Recruits!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today I want to announce a small hotfix with notes of this new Queeny Army patch, it contains very few but significant changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Before I want to thank my community for giving their feedback so that this game improves even more.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-The menu in Speedrun mode now replaces the \"GUIDE\" section, which I do not see very necessary in this game mode, with the restart option, which is more necessary in this mode, so you can restart your Run if you failed something. .",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-I eliminated the lives in the Speedrun mode since, as in the previous aspect, I did not see them necessary since the objective is to make the best time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Now the Chronometer shows the correct format 00H, 00M, 00S, 00C instead of 0H, 0M, 0S, 0C",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-I added a small section where it appears in a box with which girl you made the best time of your Speedrun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Fixed an Error where the Run of the Socket showed an amount that did not correspond",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and I think that's it, greetings recruits and see you in the next update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
