  {
   "id": "queeny-army-126565@1.1.5",
   "gameId": "queeny-army-126565",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.5",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-02-04T06:48:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello recruits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Is a pleasure for me announcing this new patch 1.1.5, it contents new changes and features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-New dinamic HUD, now when you reach a specific area on the screen the hud will being semitranparent, that because when you reach that area the old hud hidded some elements on screen imposible to see.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Some upgrades on lore cutscenes, I upgrade some cutscenes with new pixelart style.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Change on the mission 2 background and some graphics elements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Framerate upgrade from 40 to 45 fps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-now you can't lose life if you fall when you are on invincible mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Character balances",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Marcela now deals more damage with double jump from 2 to 5 that make easy kill with her by that way: -Vanessa Special hability Endurance upgrade, now she won't lose life when she fall out the screen so, she only can recive damage by enemies and bullets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-I fix the bug where you slide form wall and your character shoot back when reach the floor, now it work normaly you can shoot at the correct direction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope this upgrade makes more fun the game for you, new features are coming soon just wait for that and enjoy the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "see you later.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
