  {
   "id": "queeny-army-126565@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "queeny-army-126565",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-11-13T05:19:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Update patch 1.0.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello Queeny Army recruits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game was updated to version 1.0.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This patch contain many changes to the game to make it more enjoyable for new players also this fix many errors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "¿What's the changes?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes on Gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Now on Easy and Normal mode, enemies don't deal damage by contact except Brown cops, The Pipers (Criminals), and drones.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes to interface(HUD)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Now it show on mid/bottom the dificult level you are playing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Reserve weapon show in front of your main weapon icon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-I fix a issuise with controls when you return to main menu and it disabled the joypad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-I add a way to get back to main menu on character selection.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope this changes make a better gameplay experience, If you let me know more bugs in game, please contact me on Twitter as @SirAldelink or my email aldelink@gmail.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kind regards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
